      <a href="/en/" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300">›</span>
      <a href="/en/voiceover-services/" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">Voiceover Services</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300">›</span>
      <span class="text-gray-700">Phone Announcements</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">Phone announcements and recordings for IVR systems</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Phone announcements and voiceover recordings for PBX systems - from a single welcome message to a full IVR tree. We work with Slican, Platan, Asterisk, 3CX and all popular VoIP centrals. <%= voiceCount %>&nbsp;voice artists, delivery in 24-48h, ready file in the required format (WAV, MP3, GSM).
    </p>
    <p class="text-accent font-bold text-xl mt-4">from EUR 90 net</p>
  </div>
