<!-- AIO-targeted: "what is IVR" -->
<section class="py-8 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">What are IVR recordings and what do they contain?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">
      <strong>IVR (Interactive Voice Response) recordings are professional voice messages played by company phone systems</strong>: welcome, voice menu, after-hours messages, busy line announcement. At Powitania.pl studio we produce IVR recordings from <strong>EUR 90 net</strong> (up to 100 words), with multilingual options and a 12-month modification guarantee.
    </p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 border-b border-gray-200">
          <tr>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">IVR recording element</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Typical length</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">File format</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-900">Main greeting</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">5-15 seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">WAV 8 kHz μ-law / MP3</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-900">Voice menu (4-5 options)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">15-30 seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">WAV 8 kHz μ-law / MP3</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-900">After-hours message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">10-20 seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">WAV 8 kHz μ-law / MP3</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-900">Busy line message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">10-15 seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">WAV 8 kHz μ-law / MP3</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-900">Holiday / vacation message</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">15-25 seconds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-gray-600">WAV 8 kHz μ-law / MP3</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3">
      <strong>WAV 8 kHz μ-law 8-bit</strong> is used by PBX systems (Slican, Panasonic, Cisco, Avaya). <strong>MP3 192 kbps</strong> is accepted by VoIP systems based on Asterisk, FreePBX, 3CX. We deliver files in the format required by your central system.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

