    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">Each phone system has its own technical requirements for audio file format. The table below lists specifications for the most popular PBX and VoIP systems in Europe. We deliver files in the format required by your integrator - configured ready to upload.</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 border-b border-gray-200">
