<!-- Voice for hotline / customer service line -->
<section class="py-12 border-b border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Voice for consumer, B2B and crisis hotlines</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">A professional voice for a hotline is the first contact a customer has with your brand - it must sound competent, warm and clear. We pick the voice based on hotline type and industry: different narration tones work in different contexts.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Consumer hotline</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">More dynamic, positive tone. Works for e-commerce, retail, telecom, B2C services. The customer feels they reached a company ready to help - not an office. We produce welcome announcements, IVR menus, busy line messages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">B2B / corporate hotline</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Formal, professional tone. Banking, insurance, software houses, legal services. Concise messages, no conversational naturalness - the customer is looking for specific information and competence. Voice artists with low, confident voices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Crisis / support hotline</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Calming, composed tone. Complaint lines, helplines, technical support for outages, health hotlines. Slower narration pace, clear diction, warm voice - a stressed caller needs empathy, not sprint.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      We work with banks, telecoms, insurers, SaaS and e-commerce companies - for each industry we pick a different voice. <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Listen to samples</a> or <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">drop us a line</a> describing the hotline type you're designing - we'll propose 2-3 voice artists with a test sample.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

