<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="py-16 bg-stone-100/60 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-10">Answers to questions that come up most often when ordering a phone announcement.</p>

    <div class="space-y-3">
      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>How much does a phone announcement recording cost?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Base rate EUR 90 net for a recording up to 100 words (which can be 4 short announcements of 25 words each, or one longer announcement). Price includes a perpetual licence - granted indefinitely, with no subscription fees. Full pricing breakdown in our <a href="/en/pricing/" class="text-accent hover:underline">pricing</a> section.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>How quickly will I receive files for installation in my PBX?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Standard IVR delivery - 24-48 hours from text approval. We deliver files in the format matching your PBX (most often WAV 8 kHz mono PCM for PBX systems, MP3 or WAV 44.1 kHz for newer VoIP). We agree the format specification before recording.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Do you record announcements in foreign languages?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes. We have native voice artists for most European languages (English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Ukrainian). Native voice artist rates are usually about 2× higher than Polish ones. We regularly produce multilingual IVR for clients with offices in Europe - e.g. Polish-English IVR with separate menu branches for each language.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Can I install the recording on multiple PBX systems?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes. The phone announcement licence is perpetual and covers installation on PBX systems within a single company without instance limits. If you plan to use the recording across multiple separate legal entities (e.g. franchise, capital group) - <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-accent hover:underline">contact us</a> for a dedicated quote.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>What about background music and waiting time?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We offer royalty-free original music tracks (EUR 30 net) that can be safely used in the PBX without licensing fees. We can mix the voice recording with background music for a complete Music on Hold effect - the client receives a ready file to upload to the PBX without having to mix it themselves.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>How much does a full IVR tree (10 messages) cost?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">A full IVR tree with 10 messages (greeting, main menu, submenu, after-hours messages, GDPR clause, busy line, holidays, hotline, emergency contact, end-of-call) usually fits within 200-300 words. Cost: <strong>from EUR 125 net</strong> (101-200 words) to <strong>~EUR 190 net</strong> for 300 words - linear pricing based on text length, single voice artist. Multilingual package (PL+EN+DE): <strong>from EUR 35 net</strong> surcharge per language.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm group">
        <summary class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Can I get sample announcement scripts to use?</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Yes. On this page you'll find <strong>9 ready-to-use templates</strong> to copy (greeting, IVR menu, busy line, holiday, medical hotline, e-commerce, public sector, crisis hotline, technical message). Each template has a "Copy" button - just substitute company name and specific data.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

